# Normalise line endings so the license fixtures stay byte-identical across
# platforms. The judge is content-based and the tests compare against canonical
# texts fetched verbatim, so a CRLF conversion on checkout would quietly alter
# the input the suite is asserting on.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
LICENSE text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf